      "report": "12/D/2 RAR CONTACTED 6 VC MOVINGNE TO SW AT 1ST LOC STATED. RES; 4VC KIA BC, 1 VC WIA AND1 X M1 GARAND, 1 NVN TYPE 50 7.62 SMG AND 1 CHICOM TYPE 43SMG CAPTURED. A BLOOD TRAIL TO NE WAS FOLLOWED BY ATRACKING TEAM BUT WAS LOST AT A RIVER AT 2ND LOC STATED.A  DOCUMENT TAKEN FROM ONE OF THE KIA, DATED 23 OCT 67,REVEALED HE WAS VO VAN PHUNG, COMD OF THE XUYEN MOCDISTRICT PL.\n\n10:48hrs; 108 Fd Bty fires on possible VC escape routes in the area YS587586. (AWM95 3/7/6.pdf p14 4 Fd Regt Diary)",
